'''Location''': Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA


== Biography ==

Hailing from Milwaukee, Wisconsin, The Revomatics bring a high octane set of both original and standard surf songs to the stage. The Revomatics were honored to open for Dick Dale in 2011 and again in 2014. The band regularly performs at classic car shows, Tiki events, rockabilly weekenders and various festivals. Please contact info@therevomatics.com for more information.

== Band Members ==

 * Drew De Lutio, guitar
 * Joe Weigel, guitar
 * Pete Flessas, bass guitar
 * Jeff Schneider, drums

